\itemize{
\item a first colour stratification updates both the sample layer and the
translated-axis densities
\item a later symbol stratification leaves those densities as they are
\item if a symbol stratification is applied first and a colour stratification is
added later, the translated-axis densities are rebuilt when the colour
stratification is added
